Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value RELEASE (.+?)
Value DEVICE (\S+)
Value UPTIME (.+?)
Value LAST_REBOOT_REASON (.+?)
Value BOOT_IMAGE (\S+)

Start
  ^Comware\s+[Pp]latform\s+[Ss]oftware\s*$$
  ^(?:H3C\s+)?Comware\s+[Ss]oftware,\s+Version\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION},\s+${RELEASE}\s*$$
  ^H3C\s+${DEVICE}\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^Last\s+reboot\s+reason:\s*${LAST_REBOOT_REASON}\s*$$
  ^Boot\s+image:\s+${BOOT_IMAGE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Slot\s+\d+:\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^Copyright.*$$
  ^\s*$$

